  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "economic-adj",
      "economical-adj"
    ],
    "note": "**Economic** is about trade, industry, and money in general (*economic growth*, *an economic crisis*), or about whether something makes enough money to be worth doing. **Economical** means using little money, fuel, or other things (*an economical car*, *an economical way to heat a house*). Do not use **economic** to mean that something uses little fuel or money."
  },
